GOVERNMENT COMPANY
Demerits of Government Company
BOD
Freedom only in name: As Government is the majority shareholder, it exercises
control over affairs of the company and provisions of the Companies Act does not
have much relevance.
Lack of Accountability: As it is financed by the government, it should be
accountable to the government.
Defeat of main Purpose: Being a major shareholder, the government controls the
whole management and administration of the company. It defeats the main
purpose of registering it under the Companies Act.
