GLOBAL ENTERPRISES OR
MULTINATIONAL COMPANIES
Global Enterprise or Multinational Company (MNC) is a company whose business
operations extend beyond the country in which it has been incorporated. Global
enterprises have their head office in one country, but they carry on business
operations in other countries, known as host countries.
MNCs are also known as 'Supernatural Companies' or 'Transnational Companies'.
